# Fireblast's own Mode$ AlternativeCost static (StaticAbilityAlternativeCost,
# CR 118.9): option 1 casts it by sacrificing two Mountains instead of its
# mana cost; it deals 4 to the opponent. The two Mountains left the
# battlefield under the human's control, so Countless Gears Renegade's
# Revolt$ True ETB trigger (CardTraitBase.java:323-330, Player.hasRevolt)
# fires and creates a Servo.
startturn human
advance 3
queue option 1
queue targets ai
queue sacrificechoice 3,4
castspell human 1
resolvestack
tapformana human 5 W
tapformana human 6 W
queue paygeneric W
